# Walkthrough — Phase 2 Implementation Complete

We have completed **Phase 2: Core Financial CRUD & Section 17 Payment Ingestion API** for **FinanceFlow AI**.

---

## Accomplishments Overview

### 1. Company Management Module (`/api/companies`)
- Built `company.model.js`, `company.service.js`, `company.controller.js`, `company.routes.js`.
- Implemented `GET /api/companies`, `GET /api/companies/:id`, `POST /api/companies`, and `PUT /api/companies/:id`.
- Created documentation files (`company.controller.md`, `company.service.md`, `company.routes.md`, `company.model.md`).

### 2. Loan Management & Automatic Repayment Schedule Generator (`/api/loans`)
- Built `loan.model.js`, `loan.service.js`, `loan.controller.js`, `loan.routes.md`.
- Implemented `POST /api/loans`: When a loan facility is created, `createLoanService()` calculates total interest and monthly installment amounts, starts a MySQL ACID transaction, inserts the `loans` record, and **automatically generates monthly installment schedule records in `repayment_schedules`**.
- Created documentation files (`loan.controller.md`, `loan.service.md`, `loan.routes.md`, `loan.model.md`).

### 3. Repayment Schedule Module (`/api/repayments`)
- Built `repayment.model.js`, `repayment.service.js`, `repayment.controller.js`, `repayment.routes.js`.
- Implemented `GET /api/repayments/loan/:loanId` and `GET /api/repayments/due` for querying overdue/pending cash flows.
- Created documentation files (`repayment.controller.md`, `repayment.service.md`, `repayment.routes.md`, `repayment.model.md`).

### 4. Section 17 Payment Manual Ingestion & Duplicate Check API (`POST /api/payments/ingest`)
- Built `payment.model.js`, `reconciliationCase.model.js`, `payment.service.js`, `payment.controller.js`, `payment.routes.js`.
- Implemented `POST /api/payments/ingest`: Accepts raw payment payload (`transactionId`, `amount`, `paymentDate`, `senderName`, `senderAccount`, `reference`).
- **Duplicate Prevention**: Checks for existing `transaction_id`. Returns HTTP 409 Conflict if duplicate detected.
- **Case Container Opening**: Opens an investigation container record in `reconciliation_cases` (`status = 'open'`) alongside the ingested payment record (`status = 'unmatched'`).
- Created documentation files (`payment.controller.md`, `payment.service.md`, `payment.routes.md`, `payment.model.md`).

